WEBVTT

00:06:59.788 --> 00:07:01.413
And I’m very close to my sister,

00:07:01.413 --> 00:07:02.413
we are twins.

00:07:02.413 --> 00:07:03.954
I have an identical twin sister.

00:07:03.954 --> 00:07:08.829
I don't talk a lot about being a twin
because people ask stupid twin questions.

00:07:09.121 --> 00:07:10.204
They do, without fail.

00:07:10.204 --> 00:07:12.246
Whenever I say I’m an identical twin,

00:07:12.288 --> 00:07:14.413
someone will go, “Do you guys look alike?”

00:07:14.496 --> 00:07:15.871
(Laughter)

00:07:16.246 --> 00:07:18.538
Well, nothing gets past you, huh?

00:07:18.538 --> 00:07:19.538
(Laughter)

00:07:19.538 --> 00:07:21.746
You’re a sharp one.

00:07:22.579 --> 00:07:24.663
We’re very different personality-wise,

00:07:24.663 --> 00:07:27.371
which is what always
freaks people out when they meet us.

00:07:27.413 --> 00:07:29.704
Like, I’m very silly and playful

00:07:29.704 --> 00:07:32.538
and my sister is very dark and sarcastic.